The Wrecking Crew is an American documentary film directed by
Denny Tedesco, son of guitarist Tommy Tedesco.

11
01:19:21,428 --> 01:19:27,428
It covers the story of the Los Angeles–based group of session musicians known as the Wrecking Crew,
famed for having played on numerous hit recordings throughout the 1960s and early 1970s.

12
01:26:34,285 --> 01:26:40,285
The film premiered at the 2008 South by Southwest Film Festival, although it
did not receive a commercial theatrical release until 2015.

13
